// Live online Cambridge IGCSE, A-Level, Pearson Edexcel, IB Diploma,
// and American AP for expat and international families across Milan,
// Rome, Florence, Turin, Bologna, and Naples.
//
// LEGAL POSITIONING NOTE — READ BEFORE EDITING:
// Italy is a CONFIDENT market, closer to Denmark/Ireland than to Spain.
// Istruzione parentale (home education) is genuinely legal and
// notification-based, grounded in Constitution Art. 30 and Legislative
// Decree 297/1994 Arts. 111-112. Parents declare "capacita tecnica ed
// economica" to the local dirigente scolastico each year. There is no
// authorisation to be refused. (One low-quality English-language source
// online claims Italy requires a permit — it is wrong, and contradicted
// by LAIF, by the Italian-language school circulars, and by the statute
// itself. Do not soften this page on the basis of that claim.)
//
// TWO OPERATIONAL FACTS THAT ARE THE COMPETITIVE WEDGE — keep prominent:
//
// 1. ANNUAL EXAMS STOP AT 16. Students in istruzione parentale sit the
//    esame di idoneita annually to progress a year, but ONLY until the
//    obbligo di istruzione is discharged at 16. After that, no further
//    annual exams are required unless the student wants to enrol in a
//    state or paritaria school. This maps directly onto the product:
//    IGCSE years run alongside the Italian exam, A-Level years do not.
//    No competitor page states this clearly.
//
// 2. THE PROGETTO DIDATTICO-EDUCATIVO IS THE EXAM SPEC. The exam
//    application (due 30 April, exam sat by 30 June) must attach the
//    educational project actually followed that year, and the commission
//    builds the paper FROM that document. A family teaching Cambridge in
//    English must produce this in Italian. Documented curriculum,
//    contact hours, and progress records are exactly what it needs.
//
// EXAM CENTRE HONESTY NOTE: British Council Italy stopped delivering
// Cambridge English exams in April 2023. That is the English-language
// certificate suite, NOT Cambridge International IGCSE/A-Level — but
// current British Council provision for IGCSE/A-Level private candidates
// in Italy could not be confirmed. Every reference below therefore
// routes families through Cambridge-authorised international schools
// accepting external candidates, and says registration is confirmed per
// family per session. Do not add a bare "British Council Italy" exam
// claim without verifying it first.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

